WEBVTT

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:10.900
Boss...

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:14.300
What's going to happen to us?

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.920
Don't worry.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.990
If we keep believing in the Precure, we'll be fine.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.180
HeartCatch

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.640
Precure!

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.230
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.190
Now, all together

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.690
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.270
Within each of our chests,

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.950
they begin to sprout

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.610
The seeds of the heart

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:03.910
are growing

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.540
bit by bit

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.200
Red,

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:07.830
white

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.120
and yellow

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.880
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.340
all varied colors

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:14.810
that they

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.960
shine so brightly!

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:22.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.760
with such care

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:27.480
will never wither

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.110
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.990
Now, all together

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.440
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.110
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:43.990
They're always right by our sides

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:44.820
So together

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:48.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.630
bloom even more!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.170
HeartCatch

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.670
Precure!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:07.690
For the Earth, and For Our Dreams<i>!</i>

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:07.690
For the Earth, and For Our Dreams<i>!</i>

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:26.970
Father!

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:51.510
Yuri...

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.710
I have no right to hold you in my arms.

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:03.550
All of this was because of the weakness in my heart.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:10.310
The Great Heart Tree, protector of all lives and hearts...

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.980
I believed that by studying it...

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.030
I could bring happiness to the world.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.030
As if by magic.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:33.280
I convinced myself it was possible to just make people happy,

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:35.380
and refused to accept the truth.

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:43.280
Happiness is something we all find for ourselves, slowly but surely.

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:47.720
But to complete my research,

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:52.180
I allied myself with Dune, and 
allowed him to rob me of my heart.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:58.310
And I became Sabark: his minion, 
hell-bent on destroying the world.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.860
Yuri, I'm so...

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.160
Cure Moonlight!

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:34.020
Get away from Professor Sabark!

00:05:58.590 --> 00:05:59.600
Father?

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.010
I'm sorry, Yuri.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:09.890
I ended up creating Dark Precure for the sole purpose of bringing you misery.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:16.270
She existed purely to destroy Cure Moonlight—

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.070
a doll without a heart.

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:24.120
But it's okay now, Dark Precure.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.070
It's all over.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.360
Yuri.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:41.960
I created Dark Precure using the fruits of my research into the Great Heart Tree

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:45.920
and cells from your own body.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:48.720
She is your sister.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:04.470
I forced my daughters to fight each other.

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:08.750
Dark Precure...

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.830
You are my daughter.

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:24.070
Father.

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:23.790
Such a heart-wrenching tale.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.710
I did so enjoy it.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:33.570
You never cease to amuse me, Professor Tsukikage.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:12.590
Dune!

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:18.050
Don't you go blaming me, Professor Tsukikage!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.220
It was you who wanted to make use of my power.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.890
When you were conducting research in France,

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.810
you <i>chose</i> to become one of us.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:57.170
And your research proved most helpful in
 breaching the Great Heart Tree's defenses.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.070
Thank you, Professor Tsukikage.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:03.500
I couldn't have desiccated this planet without you.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:13.520
And now your last hope, the Precure, 
will learn unyielding despair at my hands!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.510
I suppose you hate me too?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.140
Bravo!

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.640
You're far too weak!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.330
The weak are but prey for the strong.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:56.970
Is that not the natural order?

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.010
Father!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:14.690
Yuri.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.650
Look after your mother.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:27.160
Father!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.330
Father...

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:45.800
Father!

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:55.320
Dune!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:14:00.230
Am I to have a taste of your hatred next?

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.280
Let me go.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:11.940
I won't!

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:20.350
You can't fight just to vent your anger and hatred.

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:25.350
But I...

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.840
I do hate him!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.080
It's his fault...

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.910
that my father and Cologne were taken from me!

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:45.360
If that hatred gives me strength... then I'll use it!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.800
Don't say such awful things!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:53.770
The Yuri I admire would never say things like that!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:56.960
Please.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:01.940
If you fight with hatred in your heart, you won't win!

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:07.610
We have to find the strength to move on, 
and not get dragged down by sadness and hate!

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:14.070
Why is it we've fought as Precure this whole time?

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:22.040
What was it your father and Cologne wanted you to do?

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.040
But I...

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:28.220
I can't...

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:32.030
Tsukikage Yuri!

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:38.310
The Cure Moonlight I always respected...

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:43.000
What is it you want to do?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.710
What is it you need to do?

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.920
And what are you fighting for?

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:52.850
You have to remember!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:15.130
We'll fight not with hatred, but with love.

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:18.450
Tsubomi, let's transform.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:24.420
Right!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:28.590
Precure!

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:31.070
Open My Heart!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:42.800
The feelings that got me here all seemed so half-hearted

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:46.400
But there's no turning back now

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:55.780
I just have to trust in all my hard work, and take the first step

00:16:55.780 --> 00:17:00.610
Now's the time to take the plunge, ready, go!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:04.580
So no matter how afraid we feel

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.780
We'll never give up, cause even though you can't see it

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:14.720
We've found a treasure more precious than any other

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:20.290
In the sunny skies of my heart

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:27.860
I soar into a higher octave

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:34.690
My heart goes on, and when it resounds with all of my friends

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:42.730
Those distant dreams can one day become reality

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:38.790
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.980
Cure Blossom!

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:49.310
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:53.530
Cure Moonlight!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:18:00.660
Our limits are just an illusion we make because we're afraid

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.600
I've come to understand that now

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:13.590
You've always believed in me, been there to support me

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:19.110
You've given me such courage

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.270
You saw the way out of the dark

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:25.600
So I know your eyes will be able to see

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:32.710
The true light within that no one else can find

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:38.180
In the boundless skies of my heart

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:45.660
This melody takes flight

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:52.570
My heart goes on, and I won't let a moment go to waste

00:18:52.570 --> 00:19:00.520
And though my tears fall, slowly the seed shall bloom into a beautiful flower

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:31.720
In the sunny skies of my heart

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:39.140
I soar into a higher octave

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:46.060
My heart goes on, and when it resounds with all of my friends

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:44.110
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:52.540
Those distant dreams can one day become reality

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:54.740
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:20:00.650
By love's gentle touch, and the light of the stars, we're all shining here together

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.550
Heart Catch!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.410
Let's do this, with all our heart and soul!

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.880
HeartCatch Mirage!

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:32.370
Everyone, let's finish this!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:43.140
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.620
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:19.520
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:27.140
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:35.770
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:32.620
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:38.210
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:47.180
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:53.890
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:59.980
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.360
All those

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:08.950
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.200
Lose yourself in the melody!

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.870
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:21.080
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:27.220
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:34.600
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.770
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:43.900
<i>With our friendship...</i>

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:44.520
<i>...our courage...</i>

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:46.150
<i>...and all our hope!</i>

00:23:46.620 --> 00:23:50.030
<i>Infinite possibilities shall bloom!</i>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:53.030
<i>The grand flower, filling the cosmos!</i>

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:56.860
<i>HeartCatch Precure: Infinite Silhouette!</i>

00:23:56.860 --> 00:23:59.440
<i>Taste this punch of love!</i>

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:02.170
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:06.000
Our Hearts Unite as One<i>!</i>

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:06.000
Our Hearts Unite as One<i>!</i>

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:08.980
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
